# L §5.11: "A def whose only rule is a hole is a stub: a law not yet written ..., which prints its question."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

def relief: int = ?"the relief law is not written yet"

ask q1: relief
=== expect
q1: ?"the relief law is not written yet" (relief)
  cut 2026-01-01
